	(text_box "They keypad interface is for a 4x4 matrix membrane keypad.\n\nThe keypad buttons are polled continuously and button presses are detected by switching rows and columns HIGH/LOW and changing states between INPUT/OUTPUT.\n\nThe keypad buttons and their usage is application defined and thus not hard-set."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 63.5 0)
